      "message": "This is decidedly less clear, since before everything was explicit and straight forward and here the same operations are performed but there is simply more cruft and machinery in the way making it more expensive to parse for both man and machine.\n\nThis form is also generally more difficult in code search situations, where if I want to know who calls the constructor of GMSlide in the old code all code searches immediately take me here instead of to sk_make_sp.",
